# Customer Churn Prediction

A machine learning classification project that predicts whether a telecom customer is likely to churn based on customer account, service, and billing information.

The project covers the complete machine learning workflow from data exploration and preprocessing to model evaluation, hyperparameter tuning, model interpretation, and deployment using Streamlit.

